This project is not affiliated with Anki or Digital Dream Labs; Vector is
their product. Physical constants are cited to their published sources in
parameters.json. No third-party source files or assets are included.

In this published copy the robot's serial number and name, host names and
personal names were removed. The recorder scripts read the serial from
VECTOR_SERIAL and run_in_ct.sh reads its hosts from CAULDRON_JUMP_HOST and
CAULDRON_NODE.
